{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"سنن أبي داود","section":{"9":"Zakat (Kitab Al-Zakat)"},"section_detail":{"9":{"hadithnumber_first":1556,"hadithnumber_last":1700,"arabicnumber_first":1556,"arabicnumber_last":1700,"name_native":"كتاب الزكاة"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":1674,"arabicnumber":1674,"text":"حدثنا عثمان بن ابي شيبة، حدثنا ابن ادريس، عن ابن اسحاق، باسناده ومعناه زاد \" خذ عنا مالك لا حاجة لنا به","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Daif"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Daif"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Daif"}],"reference":{"book":9,"hadith":119}}]}